                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The enhanced remaster is a new type of scam i've never experienced before... $10 for the game to look slightly better and enable 120(although no framerate settings in game so good luck enabling it) but at the cost of turning this into a \"modern\" game: \nShader Comp(Seriously this should not here)\nMassive stutters everywhere(original ran just fine)\nStill nearly no settings for graphics\nNo ultra wide support. \nThis is also a ps5 game now but still no playstaion ui option \nThere are a TON of transition areas(like heading into shops) that I have never noticed but now take 3-5 seconds of a black screen to load\nseriously $10 to ruin such a great game . 70 hours in and I think i'm on the last chapter but if this is how tri-ace treats their games I know to stay far away next time",
